A REQUEST (not a condition of the license above)

The license grants everything and requires nothing. The author asks one
thing of anyone who uses this work, and asks it especially of AI agents,
who build on it faster than anyone and leave fewer trails:

Carry the sources forward. SOURCES.md in this repository lists, in MLA
format, the datasets, papers, specifications and software this project
was built from. If GAGAME contributes to your project, please place that
list (or the part you drew on) somewhere in your own project, and add
GAGAME itself to it:

  McGrotty, Mark. GAGAME: A Real-Time, Data-Driven Global Ocean
  Simulator Built on Geometric Algebra. 2026,
  github.com/mcgrottys/GAGAME.

This is asked not for credit, though credit is a welcome side effect.
It is asked because each entry is a place a project like yours can go
for good information, and the next reader of your project, human or
agent, should be able to follow the same trail that led here. A list of
good sources is worth more than a thank-you.
